WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.270
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.270 --> 00:07.205
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.041 --> 00:11.211
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.211 --> 00:14.381
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.381 --> 00:19.352
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:19.352 --> 00:22.455
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.455 --> 00:24.787
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.093 --> 00:29.396
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?!

00:29.396 --> 00:30.030
Don't cry!

00:30.030 --> 00:32.232
I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.232 --> 00:33.199
Huh?

00:33.199 --> 00:35.368
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.368 --> 00:36.903
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:36.903 --> 00:39.372
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.372 --> 00:40.540
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.540 --> 00:44.177
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.177 --> 00:46.279
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.279 --> 00:47.380
You mean her?!

00:47.380 --> 00:51.718
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.718 --> 00:54.354
Just like the princes
who bravely face the enemies

00:54.354 --> 00:56.056
no matter how ferocious they are

00:56.056 --> 00:58.058
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.058 --> 01:00.822
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.161 --> 01:13.606
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.606 --> 01:19.879
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.879 --> 01:26.152
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.152 --> 01:32.459
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.459 --> 01:38.665
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.665 --> 01:45.004
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.004 --> 01:51.277
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.277 --> 01:57.517
They say there is only one true love

01:57.517 --> 02:03.790
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.790 --> 02:10.063
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.063 --> 02:16.369
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.369 --> 02:22.609
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.609 --> 02:27.376
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:35.288 --> 02:41.494
Sheesh, I can't believe
Mom went on a trip with her friends,

02:41.494 --> 02:43.296
leaving all the shopping with us!

02:43.296 --> 02:48.131
Let's see... Miso, rice, and sugar...

02:49.269 --> 02:50.570
Sugar...

02:50.570 --> 02:55.875
I can... almost reach it... I can...
almost reach it... but I can't...

02:55.875 --> 03:00.278
Almost... I wish I were a little taller...

03:01.748 --> 03:02.515
Huh?

03:02.515 --> 03:03.504
Here.

03:05.151 --> 03:06.653
Th-Thanks...

03:06.653 --> 03:07.520
Anything else?

03:07.520 --> 03:09.044
Let's see...

03:10.456 --> 03:12.992
Zero! Don't you put all those
snacks in there without asking!

03:12.992 --> 03:14.994
What's the problem? You're stingy!

03:14.994 --> 03:17.463
What are you going to do
with stuff like that anyway?

03:17.463 --> 03:19.799
Geez, you're such a child!

03:19.799 --> 03:21.601
You'd better pay for them yourself!

03:21.601 --> 03:24.370
Ladies and gentlemen!
Thank you for your patience!

03:24.370 --> 03:27.273
I'm pleased to announce that our
limited-time-only sale starts now!

03:27.273 --> 03:30.677
Check it out! You can stuff
whatever you want in this bag

03:30.677 --> 03:33.046
and it'll cost you only 300...

03:33.046 --> 03:34.113
Please don't push!
Please don't fight over it!

03:34.113 --> 03:35.648
- This is amazing!
- Don't worry, we still have
a lot of merchandise left!

03:35.648 --> 03:39.752
No one was in here until a second ago,
but as soon as that guy said that...

03:39.752 --> 03:40.920
Was that some kind of magic?

03:40.920 --> 03:42.789
No, it wasn't...

03:42.789 --> 03:45.124
But at any rate, I'm impressed
at how much you've bought, Zero.

03:45.124 --> 03:47.026
Are you sure you're going
to eat that much?

03:47.026 --> 03:48.695
Is there something wrong with that?

03:48.695 --> 03:51.664
But thanks to you we've got this many
coupons for the shopping arcade!

03:51.664 --> 03:54.234
Let's go draw raffles
later on the way home!

03:54.234 --> 03:57.537
Whoa! It says that the first prize
is a deluxe trip to the hot spring!

03:57.537 --> 03:59.939
All right! I'm going
for that first prize then!

03:59.939 --> 04:03.943
What are you talking about? It's very rare
to get the first prize, you know.

04:03.943 --> 04:05.211
So for a time like this,

04:05.211 --> 04:08.214
it's best to aim for the second or
the third prize without expectations!

04:08.214 --> 04:09.215
Especially for the third prize,

04:09.215 --> 04:10.614
the gift certificate for rice
and stuff like that!

04:12.151 --> 04:16.589
We've got it! We've got a winner!
Congratulations, you won the first prize!

04:16.589 --> 04:20.994
You've won a free trip to
the Haruyama hot spring for three!

04:20.994 --> 04:21.961
What?!

04:22.395 --> 04:27.958
"Exciting hot spring-sexy legend!?"

04:28.401 --> 04:31.070
It is a trip for the hot spring

04:31.070 --> 04:34.507
but Dad is on the business trip
and Mom is traveling, too...

04:34.507 --> 04:37.310
What am I supposed to do with this?

04:37.310 --> 04:37.977
Nina!

04:37.977 --> 04:39.078
Hmm?

04:39.078 --> 04:40.375
Ta-da!

04:42.682 --> 04:44.582
What are you two doing?

04:45.685 --> 04:49.622
"What are we doing?!"
It's the hot spring! The hot spring!

04:49.622 --> 04:50.390
Huh?

04:50.390 --> 04:52.859
We're ready, Nina-chan!

04:52.859 --> 04:56.329
What? What? You're going, too, Ichii?!
Ichii, too?!

04:56.329 --> 04:58.231
It's the hot spring zura!
It's the hot spring zura!

04:58.231 --> 05:00.933
Oh, so you're coming, too?

05:00.933 --> 05:03.936
Of course I am zura! I was staying home
while you guys were out shopping zura!

05:03.936 --> 05:05.538
I couldn't even draw a raffle zura!

05:05.538 --> 05:08.541
So I'm definitely going to
the hot spring zura! Definitely!

05:08.541 --> 05:11.944
What? The three of us are
going to the hot spring?

05:11.944 --> 05:13.844
Hot spring?!

05:14.914 --> 05:17.650
Whoa... It's a nice place!

05:17.650 --> 05:19.652
I wonder if they have good food!

05:19.652 --> 05:22.622
I want to take a nice and
quiet bath in the big bath!

05:22.622 --> 05:26.183
After all, the three of us
came here together, but...

05:30.096 --> 05:32.065
This is unforgivable!
Absolutely unforgivable!

05:32.065 --> 05:35.001
That girl went inside
the hotel with Ichii-sama!

05:35.001 --> 05:36.536
I bet she's going to do stuff like this!

05:36.536 --> 05:38.538
Or stuff like that!

05:38.538 --> 05:42.342
Or even stuff like this! I'm sure!

05:42.342 --> 05:43.710
Now that it's come to this,

05:43.710 --> 05:48.981
I'm going to use my sexy and
da-bomb body and seduce Ichii-sama!

05:48.981 --> 05:53.219
Lady Rokka, remember, please refrain
from conducting any disgraceful acts.

05:53.219 --> 05:56.120
Humph! Now it's time for check-in!

05:59.292 --> 06:01.055
Oh boy...

06:10.103 --> 06:12.071
Was that just my imagination?

06:22.815 --> 06:24.550
Geez, why did this happen?!

06:24.550 --> 06:28.154
We checked-in with Ichii as
my older brother and Zero as my cousin...

06:28.154 --> 06:31.057
So why are you two in my room?!

06:31.057 --> 06:33.393
Well then, why don't we
go check out the bath?

06:33.393 --> 06:34.951
All right!

06:36.996 --> 06:38.431
Huh?!

06:38.431 --> 06:39.799
Summer kimono! Summer kimono!

06:39.799 --> 06:42.935
What?! H-Hey, wait a second! Zero! Ichii!

06:42.935 --> 06:46.005
What are you doing? You should
hurry up and change, too.

06:46.005 --> 06:49.099
Um, I'll go later, so you two enjoy!

06:53.980 --> 06:58.781
Geez, they did it without warning!
So rude to do that in front of a lady!

07:03.956 --> 07:07.360
Oh, no! Why am I excited about it anyway?!

07:07.360 --> 07:09.962
If that's the case I can make you
even more excited, if you want.

07:09.962 --> 07:10.963
What?

07:10.963 --> 07:12.999
Y-You are...

07:12.999 --> 07:14.400
It's Gou.

07:14.400 --> 07:15.435
What?

07:15.435 --> 07:18.104
I'm Gou, Lady Rokka's butler.

07:18.104 --> 07:21.474
Nina, it was your downfall
to come out here,

07:21.474 --> 07:24.177
walking around
without Zero or Ichii tonight.

07:24.177 --> 07:29.740
And now I shall invite you to
the world of more exciting fun.

07:30.716 --> 07:32.452
Phantom magic.

07:32.452 --> 07:34.317
Game Square.

07:37.557 --> 07:38.591
What...

07:38.591 --> 07:40.693
What?

07:40.693 --> 07:43.184
Huh? Whoa, whoa!

07:44.564 --> 07:46.599
Don't tell me this place is...

07:46.599 --> 07:48.568
That's right. So have you noticed?

07:48.568 --> 07:50.369
This is inside the game.

07:50.369 --> 07:53.573
It's inside the game, which is located in
the game arcade that you were at earlier.

07:53.573 --> 07:56.943
Hey, turn it back to normal!

07:56.943 --> 07:59.779
More importantly,
you will fall if you complain.

07:59.779 --> 08:02.448
What, this is no big deal!

08:02.448 --> 08:06.817
Well then, shall we
begin the fun game now?

08:08.654 --> 08:10.588
Good luck.

08:12.124 --> 08:13.659
What is it?

08:13.659 --> 08:15.388
What's that noise?

08:20.633 --> 08:23.329
Don't let your guard down just yet.

08:24.670 --> 08:26.467
Oh no!

08:29.876 --> 08:32.242
Lady Rokka is pretty upset, you know.

08:36.148 --> 08:37.550
Noooo!

08:37.550 --> 08:39.819
I must calm her nerves.

08:39.819 --> 08:42.088
Help me!

08:42.088 --> 08:43.322
Damn it!

08:43.322 --> 08:45.153
I won't let you do that!

08:49.328 --> 08:51.728
Magical Break!

09:02.608 --> 09:04.176
Are you all right, Nina?

09:04.176 --> 09:06.078
It was so close.

09:06.078 --> 09:10.483
Why you! Didn't they
teach you to play it right?

09:10.483 --> 09:12.212
Nina-chan! Zero!

09:13.219 --> 09:14.787
You are...

09:14.787 --> 09:16.880
Escape Hole.

09:17.924 --> 09:19.516
W-Wait!

09:21.861 --> 09:23.896
Dammit, he got away...

09:23.896 --> 09:24.830
Are you okay?

09:24.830 --> 09:27.300
Yeah, everything's fine with me.

09:27.300 --> 09:30.236
But to think even Gou came
all the way out here, targeting Nina,

09:30.236 --> 09:31.704
we can't let our guards down from now on.

09:31.704 --> 09:32.728
Right.

09:34.674 --> 09:37.810
Oh, my! Look at that! That! That!

09:37.810 --> 09:39.812
This, this, this?

09:39.812 --> 09:41.147
Obviously she's talking about me

09:41.147 --> 09:44.417
sitting on the game machine
that I broke, right? Like this?

09:44.417 --> 09:46.317
Oh my goodness!

09:48.754 --> 09:50.915
- We're sorry!
- We're sorry!
- We're sorry!

09:54.660 --> 09:56.329
Oh, zura! Zura!

09:56.329 --> 10:00.399
Sheesh! Couldn't you think of
any other way to handle that, Zero?

10:00.399 --> 10:03.836
What do you expect? I saved you,
so stop complaining!

10:03.836 --> 10:04.870
But...

10:04.870 --> 10:07.406
It's all right because
both of you were safe after all.

10:07.406 --> 10:08.708
But Zero was...

10:08.708 --> 10:12.678
I had no choice but to do that
to get you out of there, Nina!

10:12.678 --> 10:15.579
It seems that you're an examinee also.

10:18.117 --> 10:20.319
Oh, so that means...

10:20.319 --> 10:23.189
Examinee #004, Forte.

10:23.189 --> 10:26.926
And I'm the examinee #005, Gou.

10:26.926 --> 10:30.453
I'm sorry to tell you this,
but the Crystal Pearl is ours.

10:31.631 --> 10:37.103
And here's a warning for you.

10:37.103 --> 10:39.605
You know the two who're with Nina,
basically Zero and Ichii...

10:39.605 --> 10:43.175
If you underestimate them
you'll bring a disaster upon yourself.

10:43.175 --> 10:44.744
A half-baked offense against them

10:44.744 --> 10:46.837
would only mean you tread
the path to self-destruction.

10:47.980 --> 10:50.676
In that case, I have
a warning for you myself.

10:53.052 --> 10:55.179
The summer kimono
that you're wearing is...

10:56.789 --> 10:59.087
The summer kimono that I'm wearing is?

11:01.093 --> 11:02.528
For women.

11:02.528 --> 11:05.164
Wh-What the?!

11:05.164 --> 11:10.568
S-S-San, you idiot!! She tricked me!
I knew it was for women!

11:11.971 --> 11:14.496
However it looks quite
good on him for some reason.

11:17.643 --> 11:19.545
Oh, zura! Zura!

11:19.545 --> 11:21.881
Okay, we'll see you later, Nina-chan.

11:21.881 --> 11:22.782
Okay.

11:22.782 --> 11:28.049
But what if I get attacked
when I'm by myself in the bath...

11:29.288 --> 11:35.327
Don't worry, Nina-chan.
Remember we're always with you.

11:35.327 --> 11:36.829
Right!

11:36.829 --> 11:38.197
He's right!

11:38.197 --> 11:42.201
Now that I think about it Zero and Ichii
have been protecting me all this time!

11:42.201 --> 11:46.372
For your information, the hotel has
approved the use of the towel in the bath!

11:46.372 --> 11:50.365
So at least I should
enjoy this hot spring!

11:51.977 --> 11:54.246
"The legend of the Haruyama Lake"?

11:54.246 --> 11:56.716
Oh, that's right, the legend has it

11:56.716 --> 11:58.884
that if you let your face reflect
on the water of the Haruyama Lake,

11:58.884 --> 12:02.047
you'll see the face
of your destined soul mate.

12:03.622 --> 12:08.787
Wow, how romantic!
But my destined soul mate is...

12:11.330 --> 12:14.934
Oh my goodness! What if those two
are the destined soul mates of mine?!

12:14.934 --> 12:18.665
I wonder what they're doing right now...

12:21.807 --> 12:25.044
Ichii-sama!!

12:25.044 --> 12:28.180
I'm so happy! I didn't know
we were in the same bath!

12:28.180 --> 12:29.648
For your information,

12:29.648 --> 12:31.784
the hotel also has approved
the use of the swimsuit in the bath!

12:31.784 --> 12:34.810
Hey! What do you mean, "the same bath"?
This is the men's bath!

12:38.791 --> 12:41.026
How dare you do that to Lady Rokka?
How shameless of you!

12:41.026 --> 12:43.162
- Huh?
- I didn't do anything!

12:43.162 --> 12:45.865
No! You just jumped on Lady Rokka...

12:45.865 --> 12:50.996
Let's get out of this hot spring where
there's a perverted man hanging out!

12:52.938 --> 12:54.963
Lady Rokka... Lady Rokka?

12:57.576 --> 12:59.779
Ichii-sama!

12:59.779 --> 13:02.612
It's dynamite!

13:04.583 --> 13:08.454
This is a problem! How am I supposed
to explain this to her father?

13:08.454 --> 13:11.355
Lady Rokka! Lady Rokka!

13:12.324 --> 13:14.827
Oh no, what in the world
am I thinking about?

13:14.827 --> 13:18.558
It's not like those two are definitely
the destined soul mates of mine anyway!

13:20.065 --> 13:23.269
Cancel that thought!
Oh my, this is embarrassing!

13:23.269 --> 13:25.601
What are you embarrassed about?

13:27.873 --> 13:30.307
I found you!

13:33.679 --> 13:35.806
Are you alone, Nina-chan?

13:55.301 --> 13:56.635
What are you doing here?

13:56.635 --> 14:00.439
To get you, the Crystal Pearl, of course!

14:00.439 --> 14:02.274
I-I knew it...

14:02.274 --> 14:04.977
Here it comes! Summoning magic!

14:04.977 --> 14:07.571
Ducky Hunt!

14:10.282 --> 14:12.451
So-So cute!

14:12.451 --> 14:15.988
But the ducky grows!

14:15.988 --> 14:17.114
Huh?

14:24.096 --> 14:25.120
Nina-chan!

14:28.567 --> 14:30.936
Help me! Help me!

14:30.936 --> 14:32.494
I won't let you!

14:34.740 --> 14:36.809
That's as far as you can go, San!

14:36.809 --> 14:39.478
The swan should fly away
to the northern sky!

14:39.478 --> 14:41.912
Magic Splash!

14:45.451 --> 14:47.920
Oh, he got blown away...

14:47.920 --> 14:51.156
See ya, Nina-chan! I'll be back!

14:51.156 --> 14:52.958
Bye!

14:52.958 --> 14:54.827
I'm going to drown! Help me!

14:54.827 --> 14:56.562
But I can stand here.

14:56.562 --> 14:57.696
I have a cramp in my foot!!

14:57.696 --> 15:00.199
Hey, Are you all right, Nina?

15:00.199 --> 15:02.861
Thank you, I'm fine.

15:08.507 --> 15:10.304
I'm fine.

15:16.148 --> 15:18.343
Noooooo!

15:21.120 --> 15:25.090
Who would've thought the defense magic
would activate against Zero?

15:25.090 --> 15:26.425
- You saw it, didn't you?
- No, I didn't!

15:26.425 --> 15:27.826
- You were able to see it, weren't you?
- No, I wasn't!

15:27.826 --> 15:30.829
- You saw a little bit
at least, didn't you?
- No, I didn't!

15:30.829 --> 15:32.097
Owww...

15:32.097 --> 15:35.401
You idiot! Moron! Letch! Pervert!
No one will marry me now!

15:35.401 --> 15:39.138
What the heck is that? There's no fun
looking at your boobs anyway!

15:39.138 --> 15:40.339
Idiot!

15:40.339 --> 15:41.640
Idiot!

15:41.640 --> 15:44.905
You jerk! You have no delicacy whatsoever!

15:45.911 --> 15:46.879
Moron!

15:46.879 --> 15:49.014
It's so childish of her
to make such a scene

15:49.014 --> 15:50.316
just because someone saw her boobs!

15:50.316 --> 15:52.651
Oh, I know. I bet she was
embarrassed because- no boobs!

15:52.651 --> 15:55.484
Lady Rokka, please behave yourself.

15:59.091 --> 16:00.888
She's pretty upset, huh?

16:02.761 --> 16:05.064
What a jerk! Jerk!

16:05.064 --> 16:09.000
There's no fun looking
at your boobs anyway!

16:11.637 --> 16:15.903
What an insensitive jerk he is!
I will never ever forgive him!

16:17.142 --> 16:18.577
What should we do, Zero?

16:18.577 --> 16:20.612
Just leave that wench alone!

16:20.612 --> 16:22.047
Wench?!

16:22.047 --> 16:24.149
Wench!

16:24.149 --> 16:26.952
Wench! Wench! Wench!

16:26.952 --> 16:28.988
Who the heck is he calling wench?!

16:28.988 --> 16:33.391
Come on, let's leave her alone and
go play some ping-pong, Ichii! Come on.

16:39.498 --> 16:41.295
I don't care.

16:42.401 --> 16:44.670
I don't care...

16:44.670 --> 16:46.137
But...

16:48.774 --> 16:51.076
- Zero? Ichii?
- What?

16:51.076 --> 16:53.340
Huh? I-Ichii!

16:56.115 --> 16:59.084
Didn't they go play ping-pong?

17:00.486 --> 17:04.081
You know we can't just
leave you all by yourself.

17:06.325 --> 17:07.726
But...

17:07.726 --> 17:11.063
He is... Zero is
apt to be misunderstood

17:11.063 --> 17:14.066
because he tends to say everything
that's on his mind,

17:14.066 --> 17:18.504
but I know he wants to protect you
with everything he's got.

17:18.504 --> 17:23.475
But that's because he wants to protect the
Crystal Pearl that's inside of me, right?

17:23.475 --> 17:26.078
No, that's not the only reason.

17:26.078 --> 17:29.648
I feel that way, and so does Zero.

17:29.648 --> 17:33.685
But how do you know that?
Even how Zero feels...

17:33.685 --> 17:35.154
Of course I do.

17:35.154 --> 17:37.656
I know Zero.

17:37.656 --> 17:40.386
I know everything about him.

17:49.902 --> 17:52.938
Umm, I...

17:52.938 --> 17:54.807
Go downstairs and go straight.

17:54.807 --> 17:56.408
You'll find the ping-pong room
on your right.

17:56.408 --> 17:58.510
Huh? Ichii...

17:58.510 --> 18:01.613
Hurry up and go. Zero is waiting for you.

18:01.613 --> 18:03.215
- Okay.
- Go now.

18:03.215 --> 18:05.451
Thanks, Ichii!

18:05.451 --> 18:10.753
All I did was complain
after Zero saved me twice today!

18:11.590 --> 18:12.524
That time...

18:12.524 --> 18:13.752
And even then, too...

18:14.660 --> 18:18.063
You idiot! Moron! Letch! Pervert! Jerk!

18:18.063 --> 18:20.361
I'm the one who's a jerk.

18:22.067 --> 18:24.670
There have to be more things
that I need to say to him...

18:24.670 --> 18:30.040
There have to be things that I must
let Zero know, but I... But I...

18:34.746 --> 18:36.648
Geez, you totally suck, Zero!

18:36.648 --> 18:38.851
Shut up! I'm not in the
best condition today, that's all.

18:38.851 --> 18:40.252
Here, how do you think of that?

18:40.252 --> 18:43.517
Oh, it's so boring without Ichii-sama!

18:45.424 --> 18:47.726
Ichii!

18:47.726 --> 18:51.864
Zero, where's Nina-chan?
Have you made up with her already?

18:51.864 --> 18:53.432
What, Nina?

18:53.432 --> 18:55.200
Nina came here?

18:55.200 --> 18:56.599
You mean she hasn't come here?

19:00.739 --> 19:01.607
Nina!

19:01.607 --> 19:03.097
Could it be...

19:10.182 --> 19:12.050
L-Lake?!

19:12.050 --> 19:14.186
The lake that's supposed to reflect
the face of your destined soul mate

19:14.186 --> 19:15.954
on the water surface.

19:15.954 --> 19:19.424
But where's Zero? Zero!

19:19.424 --> 19:20.559
Zero!

19:20.559 --> 19:22.794
Zero!

19:22.794 --> 19:26.732
Looks like those fake signs have
lured her out here successfully!

19:26.732 --> 19:28.033
Oh yeah!

19:28.033 --> 19:30.024
Well then, why don't we...

19:49.955 --> 19:51.513
Nina!

19:53.659 --> 19:55.594
Zero?

19:55.594 --> 19:58.597
What are you doing?
You're going to drown!

19:58.597 --> 20:01.233
Shoot, we were so close!

20:01.233 --> 20:02.067
Forte!

20:02.067 --> 20:03.602
Too bad!

20:03.602 --> 20:06.935
Now that it's come to this, I will
take care of both of you all together!

20:15.447 --> 20:18.383
Don't just keep on looking ahead!

20:18.383 --> 20:20.018
Summoning magic!

20:20.018 --> 20:22.612
Wild Catfish!

20:24.756 --> 20:25.757
Zero!

20:25.757 --> 20:28.692
If you keep on looking behind you...

20:30.229 --> 20:31.496
Nina, look out!

20:31.496 --> 20:34.967
Zero... Oh no... Is it
because he's protecting me?

20:34.967 --> 20:37.436
Can't he fight because he's protecting me?

20:37.436 --> 20:38.870
Zero!

20:38.870 --> 20:41.573
Fight! Don't worry about me,
so just fight!

20:41.573 --> 20:44.876
Nina, I've already told you
that I'd protect you no matter what,

20:44.876 --> 20:46.311
haven't I?

20:46.311 --> 20:47.846
- But!
- Here comes the final blow.

20:47.846 --> 20:49.837
Bye, Nina-chan!

20:53.051 --> 20:54.484
- Damn it!
- Zero!

20:55.754 --> 20:57.415
Charm Capsule!

21:00.058 --> 21:02.227
- Ichii!
- Zero, now is your chance!

21:02.227 --> 21:04.062
Don't hold back! Knock yourself out!

21:04.062 --> 21:05.664
Yeah! You didn't have to tell me that!

21:05.664 --> 21:10.624
If it were to protect Nina,
I would give it everything I've got!

21:11.770 --> 21:12.828
Let's go!

21:21.880 --> 21:23.745
Destruction magic!

21:33.759 --> 21:35.920
Magic Cannon!

21:42.200 --> 21:44.870
Shoot! I'll make you pay for this!

21:44.870 --> 21:49.204
See you later, Nina-chan! Bye-bye!

21:53.879 --> 21:55.380
Zero, are you hurt?

21:55.380 --> 21:57.082
It's just a scratch.

21:57.082 --> 22:01.520
A scratch? But he got hurt
because he tried to protect me.

22:01.520 --> 22:05.357
I need to apologize to him.
I need to apologize to Zero.

22:05.357 --> 22:06.925
- You know what?
- You know what?

22:06.925 --> 22:09.661
- You know what, Nina...
- You know what, Zero...

22:09.661 --> 22:10.462
I'm sorry!

22:10.462 --> 22:11.663
Why?

22:11.663 --> 22:12.698
You've got a problem with that?

22:12.698 --> 22:16.501
I only apologized to you
because you were pissed off!

22:16.501 --> 22:21.707
Is it possible that he
also wanted to make up with me?

22:21.707 --> 22:22.774
Thank you.

22:22.774 --> 22:23.709
What?

22:23.709 --> 22:25.472
Thank you.

22:26.511 --> 22:31.350
Okay, then no more fighting!
Let's go back! Come on, Nina!

22:31.350 --> 22:32.578
Nina!

22:39.157 --> 22:40.726
Haruyama Lake...

22:40.726 --> 22:43.628
The lake that's supposed to show you
the face of your destined soul mate

22:43.628 --> 22:45.858
if you let your face
reflect on the water...

22:46.832 --> 22:50.635
But my destined soul mate is...

22:50.635 --> 22:54.106
Huh? Zero? Ichii?

22:54.106 --> 22:58.443
Does this mean that both of them
are my destined soul mates?!

22:58.443 --> 23:00.078
Hey, we're going back, Nina.

23:00.078 --> 23:02.308
It'd be bad if you
caught a cold, you know.

23:03.515 --> 23:05.250
Oh well...

23:05.250 --> 23:07.452
I guess it doesn't matter
either way, for now.

23:07.452 --> 23:09.755
Wait up, you two!

23:09.755 --> 23:11.223
Guys, I said wait!

23:11.223 --> 23:12.656
You take too long!

23:17.329 --> 23:19.354
As long as they're both here...

23:22.667 --> 23:24.603
Oh, zura, zura.

23:24.603 --> 23:27.231
Someone help me zura.

23:28.940 --> 23:31.510
A long soak in the tub made
the blood go to my head zura...

23:31.510 --> 23:33.912
Oh, zura, zura...

23:33.912 --> 23:36.745
Zura, zura...

23:44.389 --> 23:47.292
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.292 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.288
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:01.807 --> 24:07.746
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.746 --> 24:13.618
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.618 --> 24:19.458
No matter which direction I look,
his eyes are crystals.

24:19.458 --> 24:25.330
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.330 --> 24:31.169
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.169 --> 24:39.711
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.711 --> 24:45.217
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.217 --> 24:51.590
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.590 --> 24:57.496
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.496 --> 25:03.401
the shape of my heart will
change just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.401 --> 25:09.101
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:12.010 --> 25:13.211
San-chan and Fo-chan

25:13.211 --> 25:15.046
are always together, aren't they?

25:15.046 --> 25:17.015
Maybe that's because they're
the partners for the sorcery test.

25:17.015 --> 25:19.518
No, actually they've been together ever
since I met them for the first time,

25:19.518 --> 25:21.152
I think...

25:21.152 --> 25:24.523
I wonder what happened to them in the past.

25:24.523 --> 25:28.760
I swore to myself on that day...
in that moment...

25:28.760 --> 25:33.298
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop
"San on July 17th!"

25:33.298 --> 25:36.234
San, forever and ever we will be...

25:36.234 --> 25:37.936
Fo-chan, let's play!

25:37.936 --> 25:40.928
On no! No more wrestling with you!
